mpression_ratio": 1.6269113149847094, "no_speech_prob": 0.04060102999210358}, {"id": 21, "seek": 5436, "start": 65.24, "end": 67.4, "text": " \u00bfEn qu\u00e9 trabajo usted?", "tokens": [50908, 3841, 16257, 8057, 18099, 10467, 30, 51016], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13783394206653943, "compression_ratio": 1.6269113149847094, "no_speech_prob": 0.04060102999210358}, {"id": 22, "seek": 5436, "start": 67.4, "end": 71.16, "text": " Trabajo como responsable de atenci\u00f3n al cliente en una empresa de log\u00edstica. Paso muchas", "tokens": [51016, 314, 5305, 13440, 2617, 2914, 712, 368, 33488, 419, 6423, 68, 465, 2002, 22682, 368, 3565, 19512, 2262, 13, 14199, 78, 16072, 51204], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13783394206653943, "compression_ratio": 1.6269113149847094, "no_speech_prob": 0.04060102999210358}, {"id": 23, "seek": 5436, "start": 71.16, "end": 74.24, "text": " horas hablando con clientes, tanto por tel\u00e9fono como en persona.", "tokens": [51204, 19548, 29369, 416, 6423, 279, 11, 10331, 1515, 15284, 38821, 8957, 2617, 465, 12184, 13, 51358], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13783394206653943, "compression_ratio": 1.6269113149847094, "no_speech_prob": 0.04060102999210358}, {"id": 24, "seek": 5436, "start": 74.24, "end": 76.84, "text": " \u00bfY c\u00f3mo le est\u00e1 afectando esta situaci\u00f3n en su trabajo?", "tokens": [51358, 3841, 56, 12826, 476, 3192, 30626, 1806, 5283, 29343, 465, 459, 18099, 30, 51488], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13783394206653943, "compression_ratio": 1.6269113149847094, "no_speech_prob": 0.04060102999210358}, {"id": 25, "seek": 5436, "start": 76.84, "end": 80.8, "text": " Bastante, la verdad. Me cuesta pronunciar bien algunas palabras y noto que se me escapa", "tokens": [51488, 31915, 2879, 11, 635, 13692, 13, 1923, 2702, 7841, 7569, 11228, 289, 3610, 27316, 35240, 288, 406, 78, 631, 369, 385, 12663, 4306, 51686], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13783394206653943, "compression_ratio": 1.6269113149847094, "no_speech_prob": 0.04060102999210358}, {"id": 26, "seek": 8080, "start": 80.8, "end": 85.36, "text": " las saliva si hablo mucho. Adem\u00e1s, la expresi\u00f3n facial es importante cuando tienes a clientes", "tokens": [50364, 2439, 43540, 1511, 3025, 752, 9824, 13, 34621, 11, 635, 33397, 2560, 15642, 785, 9416, 7767, 20716, 257, 6423, 279, 50592], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12584233965192523, "compression_ratio": 1.6055045871559632, "no_speech_prob": 0.5090691447257996}, {"id": 27, "seek": 8080, "start": 85.36, "end": 89.8, "text": " cara a cara y ahora la mitad de mi cara no responde. Me siento inseguro y evitar mirar", "tokens": [50592, 10962, 257, 10962, 288, 9923, 635, 46895, 368, 2752, 10962, 572, 4196, 68, 13, 1923, 40340, 33874, 2794, 340, 288, 31326, 3149, 289, 50814], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12584233965192523, "compression_ratio": 1.6055045871559632, "no_speech_prob": 0.5090691447257996}, {"id": 28, "seek": 8080, "start": 89.8, "end": 93.44, "text": " directamente a las personas porque temo que se note demasiado.", "tokens": [50814, 46230, 257, 2439, 12019, 4021, 1383, 78, 631, 369, 3637, 39820, 13, 50996], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12584233965192523, "compression_ratio": 1.6055045871559632, "no_speech_prob": 0.5090691447257996}, {"id": 29, "seek": 8080, "start": 93.44, "end": 96.6, "text": " \u00bfHa tenido dificultad para comer o beber mientras est\u00e1 en el trabajo?", "tokens": [50996, 3841, 23745, 33104, 29615, 723, 345, 1690, 16510, 277, 40069, 26010, 3192, 465, 806, 18099, 30, 51154], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12584233965192523, "compression_ratio": 1.6055045871559632, "no_speech_prob": 0.5090691447257996}, {"id": 30, "seek": 8080, "start": 96.6, "end": 100.8, "text": " S\u00ed, se me cae un poco el l\u00edquido al beber si no tengo cuidado. Y para comer necesito", "tokens": [51154, 12375, 11, 369, 385, 1335, 68, 517, 10639, 806, 16118, 358, 2925, 419, 40069, 1511, 572, 13989, 31891, 13, 398, 1690, 16510, 11909, 3528, 51364], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12584233965192523, "compression_ratio": 1.6055045871559632, "no_speech_prob": 0.5090691447257996}, {"id": 31, "seek": 8080, "start": 100.8, "end": 105.08, "text": " hacerlo despacio porque los alimentos se me quedan en la mejilla del lado afectado.", "tokens": [51364, 32039, 4887, 24571, 4021, 1750, 38563, 369, 385, 13617, 282, 465, 635, 37758, 5291, 1103, 11631, 30626, 1573, 13, 51578], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12584233965192523, "compression_ratio": 1.6055045871559632, "no_speech_prob": 0.5090691447257996}, {"id": 32, "seek": 8080, "start": 105.08, "end": 107.52, "text": " \u00bfPadece alguna enfermedad cr\u00f3nica?", "tokens": [51578, 3841, 47, 25978, 20651, 42695, 345, 941, 1801, 2262, 30, 51700], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12584233965192523, "compression_ratio": 1.6055045871559632, "no_speech_prob": 0.5090691447257996}, {"id": 33, "seek": 10752, "start": 107.52, "end": 111.08, "text": " No hipertensi\u00f3n controlada con medicaci\u00f3n, nada m\u00e1s importante.", "tokens": [50364, 883, 4879, 15346, 694, 2560, 1969, 1538, 416, 4355, 3482, 11, 8096, 3573, 9416, 13, 50542], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17401468186151414, "compression_ratio": 1.6612377850162867, "no_speech_prob": 0.5543754696846008}, {"id": 34, "seek": 10752, "start": 111.08, "end": 114.52, "text": " \u00bfHa tenido infecciones recientes, resfriados o fiebre?", "tokens": [50542, 3841, 23745, 33104, 1536, 68, 35560, 4214, 9240, 11, 725, 69, 470, 4181, 277, 283, 414, 2672, 30, 50714], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17401468186151414, "compression_ratio": 1.6612377850162867, "no_speech_prob": 0.5543754696846008}, {"id": 35, "seek": 10752, "start": 114.52, "end": 118.28, "text": " Hace una semana tuve un resfriado leve, con algo de congesti\u00f3n, pero nada m\u00e1s.", "tokens": [50714, 389, 617, 2002, 20205, 2604, 303, 517, 725, 69, 470, 1573, 33076, 11, 416, 8655, 368, 31871, 2560, 11, 4768, 8096, 3573, 13, 50902], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17401468186151414, "compression_ratio": 1.6612377850162867, "no_speech_prob": 0.5543754696846008}, {"id": 36, "seek": 10752, "start": 118.28, "end": 121.72, "text": " \u00bfAlg\u00fan traumatismo, golpe en la cabeza o intervenci\u00f3n de tal reciente?", "tokens": [50902, 3841, 9171, 70, 9453, 35099, 6882, 11, 42032, 465, 635, 34615, 277, 17104, 5687, 368, 4023, 4214, 1576, 30, 51074], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17401468186151414, "compression_ratio": 1.6612377850162867, "no_speech_prob": 0.5543754696846008}, {"id": 37, "seek": 10752, "start": 121.72, "end": 123.11999999999999, "text": " Ninguno.", "tokens": [51074, 39417, 12638, 13, 51144], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17401468186151414, "compression_ratio": 1.6612377850162867, "no_speech_prob": 0.5543754696846008}, {"id": 38, "seek": 10752, "start": 123.11999999999999, "end": 125.6, "text": " \u00bfAlg\u00fan antecedente familiar de problemas neurol\u00f3gicos?", "tokens": [51144, 3841, 9171, 70, 9453, 23411, 1232, 1576, 4963, 368, 20720, 22510, 6623, 14047, 9940, 30, 51268], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17401468186151414, "compression_ratio": 1.6612377850162867, "no_speech_prob": 0.5543754696846008}, {"id": 39, "seek": 10752, "start": 125.6, "end": 127.32, "text": " No que yo sepa.", "tokens": [51268, 883, 631, 5290, 369, 4306, 13, 51354], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17401468186151414, "compression_ratio": 1.6612377850162867, "no_speech_prob": 0.5543754696846008}, {"id": 40, "seek": 10752, "start": 127.32, "end": 129.6, "text": " \u00bfTiene dificultad para mover brazos o piernas?", "tokens": [51354, 3841, 51, 10174, 29615, 723, 345, 1690, 39945, 1548, 27681, 277, 9766, 18979, 30, 51468], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17401468186151414, "compression_ratio": 1.6612377850162867, "no_speech_prob": 0.5543754696846008}, {"id": 41, "seek": 10752, "start": 129.6, "end": 131.2, "text": " No, solo es la cara.", "tokens": [51468, 883, 11, 6944, 785, 635, 10962, 13, 51548], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17401468186151414, "compression_ratio": 1.6612377850162867, "no_speech_prob": 0.5543754696846008}, {"id": 42, "seek": 10752, "start": 131.2, "end": 135.64, "text": " \u00bfHa tenido mareos, visi\u00f3n doble o dolores de cabeza intensos?", "tokens": [51548, 3841, 23745, 33104, 31471, 329, 11, 1452, 2560, 360, 638, 277, 17858, 2706, 368, 34615, 14056, 329, 30, 51770], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17401468186151414, "compression_ratio": 1.6612377850162867, "no_speech_prob": 0.5543754696846008}, {"id": 43, "seek": 10752, "start": 135.64, "end": 137.2, "text": " No, nada de eso.", "tokens": [51770, 883, 11, 8096, 368, 7287, 13, 51848], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17401468186151414, "compression_ratio": 1.6612377850162867, "no_speech_prob": 0.5543754696846008}, {"id": 44, "seek": 13720, "start": 137.2, "end": 139.79999999999998, "text": " \u00bfSe desv\u00eda la boca hacia un lado?", "tokens": [50364, 3841, 10637, 730, 85, 2686, 635, 34624, 21365, 517, 11631, 30, 50494], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17537101976799244, "compression_ratio": 1.6088235294117648, "no_speech_prob": 0.024030916392803192}, {"id": 45, "seek": 13720, "start": 139.79999999999998, "end": 143.39999999999998, "text": " S\u00ed, se va hacia el izquierdo, el derecho no responde.", "tokens": [50494, 12375, 11, 369, 2773, 21365, 806, 46428, 2595, 11, 806, 39055, 572, 4196, 68, 13, 50674], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17537101976799244, "compression_ratio": 1.6088235294117648, "no_speech_prob": 0.024030916392803192}, {"id": 46, "seek": 13720, "start": 143.39999999999998, "end": 146.16, "text": " \u00bfPuede cerrar el ojo del lado afectado?", "tokens": [50674, 3841, 47, 84, 4858, 10146, 5352, 806, 277, 5134, 1103, 11631, 30626, 1573, 30, 50812], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17537101976799244, "compression_ratio": 1.6088235294117648, "no_speech_prob": 0.024030916392803192}, {"id": 47, "seek": 13720, "start": 146.16, "end": 147.67999999999998, "text": " No, queda un huequito.", "tokens": [50812, 883, 11, 23314, 517, 24967, 14856, 13, 50888], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17537101976799244, "compression_ratio": 1.6088235294117648, "no_speech_prob": 0.024030916392803192}, {"id": 48, "seek": 13720, "start": 147.67999999999998, "end": 150.32, "text": " A veces tengo que ayudarme con la mano para parpadear.", "tokens": [50888, 316, 17054, 13989, 631, 20333, 35890, 416, 635, 18384, 1690, 971, 79, 762, 289, 13, 51020], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17537101976799244, "compression_ratio": 1.6088235294117648, "no_speech_prob": 0.024030916392803192}, {"id": 49, "seek": 13720, "start": 150.32, "end": 153.44, "text": " \u00bfC\u00f3mo est\u00e1 llevando esta situaci\u00f3n emocionalmente?", "tokens": [51020, 3841, 28342, 3192, 27124, 1806, 5283, 29343, 28283, 1966, 4082, 30, 51176], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17537101976799244, "compression_ratio": 1.6088235294117648, "no_speech_prob": 0.024030916392803192}, {"id": 50, "seek": 13720, "start": 153.44, "end": 154.64, "text": " Me tiene preocupado.", "tokens": [51176, 1923, 7066, 23080, 1573, 13, 51236], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17537101976799244, "compression_ratio": 1.6088235294117648, "no_speech_prob": 0.024030916392803192}, {"id": 51, "seek": 13720, "start": 154.64, "end": 157.72, "text": " En mi trabajo estoy siempre de cara al p\u00fablico y ahora me da verg\u00fcenza.", "tokens": [51236, 2193, 2752, 18099, 15796, 12758, 368, 10962, 419, 26557, 288, 9923, 385, 1120, 20209, 774, 23691, 13, 51390], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17537101976799244, "compression_ratio": 1.6088235294117648, "no_speech_prob": 0.024030916392803192}, {"id": 52, "seek": 13720, "start": 157.72, "end": 161.79999999999998, "text": " Me da miedo que se piense que estoy sufriendo un ictus o que estoy enfermo contagioso.", "tokens": [51390, 1923, 1120, 40383, 631, 369, 26274, 405, 631, 15796, 46282, 470, 3999, 517, 220, 985, 301, 277, 631, 15796, 27341, 3280, 28525, 23540, 13, 51594], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17537101976799244, "compression_ratio": 1.6088235294117648, "no_speech_prob": 0.024030916392803192}, {"id": 53, "seek": 13720, "start": 161.79999999999998, "end": 165.51999999999998, "text": " Y tambi\u00e9n me preocupa no poder hacer bien mi trabajo si esto dura mucho.", "tokens": [51594, 398, 6407, 385, 23080, 64, 572, 8152, 6720, 3610, 2752, 18099, 1511, 7433, 43416, 9824, 13, 51780], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17537101976799244, "compression_ratio": 1.6088235294117648, "no_speech_prob": 0.024030916392803192}, {"id": 54, "seek": 13720, "start": 165.51999999999998, "end": 167.12, "text": " Entiendo su preocupaci\u00f3n.", "tokens": [51780, 3951, 7304, 459, 23080, 3482, 13, 51860], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17537101976799244, "compression_ratio": 1.6088235294117648, "no_speech_prob": 0.024030916392803192}, {"id": 55, "seek": 16712, "start": 167.12, "end": 170.32, "text": " Con lo que me coment\u00e9 y lo que observo es muy probable que se trate de una par\u00e1lisis", "tokens": [50364, 2656, 450, 631, 385, 14541, 526, 288, 450, 631, 9951, 78, 785, 5323, 21759, 631, 369, 504, 473, 368, 2002, 971, 11447, 28436, 50524], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17469508473466083, "compression_ratio": 1.4898989898989898, "no_speech_prob": 0.07975126802921295}, {"id": 56, "seek": 16712, "start": 170.32, "end": 174.52, "text": " facial perif\u00e9rica, posiblemente del tipo de par\u00e1lisis de Bell.", "tokens": [50524, 15642, 680, 351, 32716, 11, 26644, 4082, 1103, 9746, 368, 971, 11447, 28436, 368, 11485, 13, 50734], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17469508473466083, "compression_ratio": 1.4898989898989898, "no_speech_prob": 0.07975126802921295}, {"id": 57, "seek": 16712, "start": 174.52, "end": 178.04, "text": " Vamos a comenzar el tratamiento lo antes posible y veremos c\u00f3mo evoluciona.", "tokens": [50734, 10894, 257, 29564, 289, 806, 21507, 16971, 450, 11014, 26644, 288, 16443, 3415, 12826, 7117, 1311, 21758, 13, 50910], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17469508473466083, "compression_ratio": 1.4898989898989898, "no_speech_prob": 0.07975126802921295}, {"id": 58, "seek": 16712, "start": 178.04, "end": 181.8, "text": " Muchas gracias doctor, aprecio que me explique con todo tan claro.", "tokens": [50910, 35669, 16611, 4631, 11, 1882, 3326, 78, 631, 385, 1490, 1925, 416, 5149, 7603, 16742, 13, 51098], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17469508473466083, "compression_ratio": 1.4898989898989898, "no_speech_prob": 0.07975126802921295}], "language": "Spanish"}